SUMMARY:Coffee and Birds
DESCRIPTION:Coffee and Birds \nStart your morning off right at Lorrimer Sanctuary with a cup of coffee and a front row seat to our new birdwatching facilities! You will be able to relax inside as well as outside on our brand-new observation deck. Bonus points if you bring your own mug! Please register so we know how much to brew! \nCurrently Brewing: \n\nJuly 12th – Birds and Beans\, Bird-Friendly Coffee\nAugust 9th –\nSeptember 13th –\nOctober 11th –\nNovember 8th –\nDecember 13th – Hot Cocoa\n\nTicket sale for each class ends at 4:00 PM on the day before the class. \nCOST: FREE \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/coffee-and-birds/2026-07-12/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Coffee-and-Birds.jpeg
GEO:40.9924503;-74.1992136
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Lorrimer Sanctuary 790 Ewing Avenue Franklin Lakes NJ 07417 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=790 Ewing Avenue:geo:-74.1992136,40.9924503
END:VEVENT
