SUMMARY:Sounds of Summer Twilight Walk
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a relaxing stroll as day turns to night! Experience the magical sounds of summer—crickets\, rustling leaves\, and gentle breezes—all around you. Perfect for nature lovers wanting to unwind and connect with the outdoors. Bring your friends\, your curiosity\, and your love for peaceful evenings. Let’s make memories on this in-person twilight adventure! \nThis program open to all ages\, but does require some moments of quiet and listening skills which may be difficult for younger patrons. \nCOST: $8 Adult ticket 18+ \, $6 Child ticket 3+  \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/sounds-of-summer-twilight-walk/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary,Nature Walk
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sounds-of-Summer-Twilight-walk-2026.jpeg
