SUMMARY:Plein Air Oil Painting with Ingrid Marie Harbour
DESCRIPTION:Paint the majestic scenery at the Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary in Bernardsville\, New Jersey\, with professional artist and experienced arts educator Ingrid Marie Harbour. Bring your outdoor painting kit and setup to soak up nature and create beautiful landscape art that soothes your senses. This 3-hour class\, geared toward adults who are serious about plein air painting\, will meet at NJ Audubon and set up. Each participant chooses their composition. A short demo by the instructor will get you painting quickly\, developing an underpainting\, using color blocking\, and capturing the moment with expressive details. Constructive feedback and guidance will be provided\, along with recommendations to enhance your experience. An approachable yet structured format encourages you to follow your inner calling to make art. Beginner-friendly and open to adult and teen artists (under 18 must be accompanied by an adult; minimum age 16) interested in oil painting outdoors. \nYou may request a curated art supply kit for $100 (not including the easel). If you request 2 weeks before the class start date\, it will be provided to you on the day of the class. A full list of suggested materials will be provided upon registration\, including what to bring and purchasing recommendations. \nOnly 10 spots available – each participant must register separately. No walk-ins\, pre-registration only. Registration closes on July 16\, 2026\, at 5:00 PM.  \nCOST: $55 \nInterested in becoming a member? Please click on the following link to learn more or join: Become a Member today! \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE \n 
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/plein-air-oil-painting-with-ingrid-marie-harbour/
LOCATION:Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary\, 11 Hardscrabble Rd\, Bernardsville\, NJ\, 07924\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adult Program,Event,Scherman Hoffman Wildlife Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/PLEIN-AIR-OIL-PAINTING-07.2026.jpeg
